    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 20(5) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, the Consumer Affairs Authority orders that no Manufacturer, Packer, Trader or Distributor shall Sell, Expose or Offer for Sale or Display for sale locally packaged bottled Drinking Water above the Maximum Retail Prices given below.",
